      "description": "Watch Al Kholood vs Al Ahli Jeddah highlights and goals from Pro League - Saudi Arabia on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 29, 2026. The stage was set for a highly anticipated Pro League clash on August 29, 2026, as both sides looked to make their mark on the season. The tension was palpable from the very first whistle as players fought for every inch of grass. Breaking the deadlock It was the home side, Al Kholood , who struck first. In the 32nd minute, Iker Kortajarena fired home after being set up by a clever assist from Coba da Costa . While the hosts held the edge, the first half remained physically demanding, evidenced by yellow cards issued to Hamed Al-Shanqiti and Al Ahli Jeddah striker Ivan Toney before the interval. Second-half drama After the restart, Al Ahli Jeddah intensified their pressure. Their efforts were rewarded in the 66th minute when Ivan Toney leveled the score following a precise assist from Eduard Spertsyan . As the clock ticked toward full time, the momentum shifted once more. Julien Domingues put the home side ahead again in the 85th minute, courtesy of an assist by Ramzi Solan . Deep into stoppage time, specifically in the 92nd minute, Mohammed Sawaan provided the final blow to seal a 3-1 victory for Al Kholood , once again assisted by the industrious Coba da Costa ."
