      "description": "Watch Diriyah Club vs Al Ahli Jeddah highlights and goals from Pro League - Saudi Arabia on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 13, 2026. On August 13, 2026 , Diriyah Club played host to Al Ahli Jeddah in a Pro League clash that promised high stakes and tactical intrigue. Both sides looked to establish their dominance early on, creating a competitive atmosphere right from the kickoff. Spertsyan Provides the Breakthrough The opening stages of the match were marked by physical play and early disciplinary action. Diriyah Club found themselves under pressure, with Zakaria Al Hawsawi and Idrissa Gana Gueye receiving yellow cards within the first twenty minutes. The deadlock was finally broken in the 25th minute when Eduard Spertsyan clinical strike found the back of the net. This pivotal goal gave Al Ahli Jeddah the momentum they needed to navigate a challenging first half. Discipline and Defensive Resilience As the second half got underway, the game became a tactical battle of attrition. Numerous substitutions were made by both managers, with the likes of Matheus Goncalves and Firas Al-Buraikan introduced to inject fresh energy. The referee remained busy, cautioning Valentin Atangana Edoa , Rayan Hamed , and Abdulelah Al Malki as the intensity peaked. In a frantic final period, Naif Masoud also went into the book, but Al Ahli Jeddah held their nerve through six minutes of stoppage time to secure a gritty away win."
